# Keep the Docker build context lean — the SDK stage restores and builds from
# source, so nothing that a local build produced belongs in the context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.claude/
.research/
# Development settings are never right in a container, and leaving the client's
# copy out keeps the dev API base address (http://localhost:5080/) from shipping
# inside the public WASM bundle. Both files are globbed, so their absence is fine.
**/appsettings.Development.json
